WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:01.639
Why ‘a lot of work’,

00:00:01.679 --> 00:00:03.264
but ‘four tasks’?

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:06.756
She types, plans,
calls and cleans.

00:00:06.796 --> 00:00:08.325
Several actions.

00:00:08.365 --> 00:00:10.049
But work,
meaning her daily

00:00:10.089 --> 00:00:11.995
effort, names all
of that as one

00:00:12.035 --> 00:00:13.801
ongoing activity.

00:00:14.337 --> 00:00:14.734
So:

00:00:14.774 --> 00:00:16.900
‘She does a lot
of work every day.’

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:18.335
Not ‘many works’.

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:20.613
To count
the actions,

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.060
choose another noun:

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.756
‘She completes four
tasks every day.’

00:00:25.503 --> 00:00:26.966
And ‘three
works of art’?

00:00:27.006 --> 00:00:27.822
Correct.

00:00:27.862 --> 00:00:30.143
Here works means
created pieces.

00:00:30.183 --> 00:00:31.650
The meaning
has changed,

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:33.821
so the grammar
changes too.

